WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
You won’t lose money if you buy it at a low price

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,540
Who said the second generation of rich people are just trash waiting to die?

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,380
Please save me

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,540
Just Jiang Lin’s shrewd vision

5
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,180
Don't see any stupid question

6
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,980
I was originally worried that he was used to living a good life.

7
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,140
Will offer high prices at will

8
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,700
As a result, I was at a disadvantage due to my bargaining skills.

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,260
The second generation of rich people who can come to major universities to study finance.

10
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,300
Sure enough, I’m not just studying gold.

11
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:33,460
Why is it you

12
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,140
this is my room

13
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:38,030
your room is nice

14
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:39,790
I am now Chen An’s resident

15
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,190
So something's wrong with you

16
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:42,950
Just chat with classmate Chen An directly

17
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:45,110
In the future, I will actually become someone else’s tenant.

18
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:47,360
And the relationship is so good

19
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,040
Could it be that they were lovers before?
